{
  "title": "Ferritin-conditioned red-cell dispersion does not establish added transferrin-receptor prediction across two NHANES samples",
  "abstract": "Among813 development and1009 target nonpregnant women aged20\u201344, adding log-ferritin\u00d7RDW to flexible routine measures reduced target log-sTfR MSE by 0.00019521 (joint source-refit/target PSU-bootstrap95% interval [-0.00148803, 0.00132256]); this does not establish incremental predictive benefit. Source PSU cross-validation slightly worsened and upper-tail trimming reversed the target gain. This is an exploratory existing-data representation test with independent-sample temporal transfer within one survey program, not external clinical-cohort validation or proof of equivalence.",
